      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Drill-through to Surface 1" location="src/client/pcf/VisualHost/control/">
        Set `sprk_drillthroughtarget` so `handleExpandClick` (VisualHostRoot) navigates to the record's threads view (the regarding-mode Timeline / standalone view) — the card is the entry point; content renders in the BFF-backed Timeline.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="T-1 count-vs-content boundary" location="docs/standards/DATA-ACCESS-DECISION-CRITERIA.md">
        VisualHost `context.webAPI` (client-fetch) honors RLS but not `internal-only` → counts only. Content flows through the BFF access filter (FR-03 Timeline). Keep the card's query strictly aggregate.
      </pattern>
